%% Sequence Diagram for Parent-Managed Youth Account APIs
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
    participant WebApp as Banking Web Application
    participant APIGateway as API Gateway
    participant YouthService as Youth Account Service
    participant AccountService as Account Service
    participant PaymentService as Payment Service
    participant TransactionService as Transaction Service
    Note over Parent,WebApp: OAuth2, RBAC enforced on all APIs
    Parent->>WebApp: Login (OAuth2)
    activate WebApp
    Note right of WebApp: Parent selects Youth Dashboard
    WebApp->>APIGateway: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard
    activate APIGateway
    APIGateway->>YouthService: GET /dashboard
    activate YouthService
    YouthService->>AccountService: Retrieve account data
    YouthService->>TransactionService: Fetch recent transactions
    TransactionService-->>YouthService: Transaction data
    AccountService-->>YouthService: Account data
    YouthService-->>APIGateway: Dashboard response
    APIGateway-->>WebApp: Dashboard response
    WebApp-->>Parent: Display dashboard
    deactivate YouthService
    deactivate APIGateway
    deactivate WebApp
    Note over Parent,WebApp: Fund Transfer (POST)
    Parent->>WebApp: Initiate fund transfer
    WebApp->>APIGateway: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer
    APIGateway->>YouthService: Fund transfer request
    YouthService->>PaymentService: Initiate transfer
    PaymentService-->>YouthService: Transfer status
    YouthService-->>APIGateway: Transfer response
    APIGateway-->>WebApp: Transfer result
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show transfer status
    Note over Parent,WebApp: Set Spending Limit (PUT)
    Parent->>WebApp: Set weekly spending limit
    WebApp->>APIGateway: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit
    APIGateway->>YouthService: Update spending limit
    YouthService-->>APIGateway: Limit updated
    APIGateway-->>WebApp: Limit update result
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show confirmation
    Note over Parent,WebApp: View Transactions (GET)
    Parent->>WebApp: View transactions
    WebApp->>APIGateway: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions
    APIGateway->>YouthService: Fetch transactions
    YouthService->>TransactionService: Query transaction history
    TransactionService-->>YouthService: Transaction list
    YouthService-->>APIGateway: Transactions response
    APIGateway-->>WebApp: Transactions data
    WebApp-->>Parent: Display transactions
